# My Task List 2026

A modern and interactive To-Do List web application built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.
This project allows users to add, edit, delete, and complete tasks while tracking progress with a dynamic progress bar.

# Features
-- Add new tasks
-- Edit existing tasks
-- Delete tasks
-- Mark tasks as completed
-- Dynamic task counter
-- Progress bar updates automatically
-- Maximum task warning effect
-- Beautiful gradient UI design
-- Responsive layout

# Technologies Used
-- HTML5
-- CSS3
-- JavaScript (Vanilla JS)

# How It Works
-- Add Tasks

* Users can type a task and click the Add Tasks button.
-- Edit Tasks

*Click the Edit button to modify any task.
-- Delete Tasks

* Tasks can be removed instantly using the Delete button.
-- Complete Tasks

* Click the checkbox to mark tasks as completed with a line-through effect.
-- Progress Tracking

The progress bar increases automatically according to the number of tasks added.


